(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: MSME INNOVATIVE SCHEME \(INCUBATION, DESIGN, IPR\) \(MSME-INNOVATIVE\) / OFFICE OF DEVELOPMENT COMMISSIONER \(MSME\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Holistic ecosystem combining Incubation grants, Professional Design) Tj
T*
(subsidies, and IPR reimbursements for patents, trademarks, and design) Tj
T*
(registrations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Any registered MSME with Udyam Registration or student/individual) Tj
T*
(   innovator affiliated with an approved Host Institute \(HI\).) Tj
T*
(2. Must have an innovative concept, product design challenge, or registered) Tj
T*
(   patent/trademark requirement.) Tj
T*
(3. Commercial potential and technological viability.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Financial assistance: Up to Rs. 15 Lakh for idea incubation; Up to Rs. 40 Lakh) Tj
T*
(   for design project \(MSME contribution 25%\); Up to Rs. 5 Lakh reimbursement) Tj
T*
(   for Foreign Patent, Rs. 1 Lakh for Domestic Patent, Rs. 10,000 for Trademark) Tj
T*
(   registration.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 75.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 40.0 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
